0109C8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/87/64/3882d90d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1637978547,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100079601,"comment_content":"总结：\n  1. 错误码由两部分组成：HTTP status code 和 业务code。业务code采用数字格式拼接而成，一般包括，服务，模块，错误三部分。\n  2. 响应体中除了错误码，还会包括 message 的简单描述、reference 指向 faq 文档。返回的错误信息中包含如何解决该错误，则是更友好的。\n  3. 注意区分内部错误和外部错误。\n  4. 如何建立内部错误、HTTP Code、Message 之间的映射关系？","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":386017,"user_name":"别天神","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1107606,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"42A08D6EF5C59A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/e6/96/eb143e46.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1703840689,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100079601,"comment_content":"这里通用的错误码定义优点是：共用，减少重复造轮子；\n同时缺点也很明显：服务信息缺失了，没办法区分错误来自哪个服务，应该还能继续改进，来表达这种错误码设计的最初意图","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":379618,"user_name":"__PlasticMan","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1676074,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"329D3E71E613F0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/93/2a/08675e68.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1692197186,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100079601,"comment_content":"实践记录：\n1. code包使用gubrak包，gubrak包的说明指出基于GOMOD模式的包使用v2版本，老师的项目实际使用的是GOPATH模式，因此需要做些调整，gubrak v2使用类似lodash的链式调用，与v1版不同；\n2. code包的init函数和错误码文档是自动生成的，可以在完成code包后完成tool&#47;codegen包；","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":367948,"user_name":"Geek_31275b","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":3505204,"ip_address":"福建","ucode":"470D3A8D963BB7","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1675760483,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100079601,"comment_content":"第二种方式，返回http 404 Not Found错误码，并在 Body 中返回简单的错误信息\n\n这个地方打错了把。\n第二种方式，返回http 400 Bad Request 错误码，并在 Body 中返回简单的错误信息","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":349562,"user_name":"yanghp","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1062906,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D7E17A5DC9FC5F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/37/fa/e1721c98.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1656066788,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100079601,"comment_content":"刚开始采用了grpc的内部错误码0-16，但是这些错误码不能很好的反应具体错误类型。后来改成了4位长度错误码，前2位模块码，后2位错误详细码","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":338391,"user_name":"aoe","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1121758,"ip_address":"","ucode":"1C6201EDB4E954","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/1d/de/62bfa83f.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1647481720,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":4,"product_id":100079601,"comment_content":"6位错误码很好用，谢谢分享","like_count":0}]}